window.products.push({"id":261046,"name":"Rhino Wrap Wine Tote TRENDING POP CULTURE (Cupcake)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uvHTNCZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why buy a card when you can \"Say it with Wine\"? Cards suck (unless they contain cash) so instead of giving a card- which will at best end up on a fireplace mantle or magnetically suspended on someone's refrigerator door, when you can \"Say it with Wine\" with a Rhino Wrap wine tote. Because we know you are classy gift giver- you will inevitably give this wine tote as a gift packed with a bottle of delicious, red or white wine. The best part of giving wine as a gift is you almost get to help drink it, so make it happen people.  Don't drink wine? Most liquor bottles fit too. Don't partake in any of the good stuff? These work with water bottles as well. Don't worry, we won't judge. (actually we probably will) Nobody better show up with a wine tote filled with water at my Birthday / Anniversary / Thanksgiving / Christmas / Hanukkah dinner if they don’t want to get tossed out with the fruit cake Grandma brought.  Believe it or not, this Rhino Wrap wine tote does more than just look good. It protects the bottle from breakage when traveling and also insulates a cold bottle for transport.  Enjoy your Rhino Wrap wine tote on every occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uvHTNCZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhino Wrap","source_asin":"B01IILUJ2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IILUJ2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IILUJ2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261047,"name":"TRANQUIL NIGHTS - 500 Thread Count 100% Cotton Bed Sheet Set, 4-Piece Aqua Queen Size Sheets, Soft & Silky Sateen Weave Luxury Bedding, Deep Pocket Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zx4RTJQtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"500 Thread Count Sateen HIGH QUALITY Long Staple Cotton - If you love the luxury and durability of hotel sheets, the look and feel of crisp cool sheets and pillowcases, you'll adore our luxurious cotton queen sheet set 500 thread count. We use yarns made with 100% long staple premium cotton fibers for a soft and silky sateen weave. Our Eco-friendly queen bed sheets retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft bedding with classic Z hem styling, also available in your choice of colors and sizes. QUEEN SIZE Luxury 4 piece Bed Sheet Set - Each set includes 1 Flat Sheet: 90\" x 102\"; 1 Fully Elasticized Fitted Sheet: 60\" x 80\" + 17\" deep pocket and 2 Pillowcases: 20\" x 30\" (Standard Pillowcases). Fitted Sheet has deep pockets to fit mattresses from 9\" to 20\". Flat sheet & pillowcases come with a classic Z hem tailored stitch for a hotel collection look. Highest quality dye materials are used for fade resistance. Recommended for regular wash and short dry cycles for superior softness. LUXURY AND COMFORT - Imagine the quality of hotel linens with the perfection of individually handcrafted cotton sheets, all at an incredible price. Our team of artisans measures each bed linen individually and stitches them to perfection. Natural long staple cotton fibers are used for the premium quality of these extra deep pocket sheets set which will instantly transform your bedding space. The fabric is tested to ensure no harmful chemicals are used, and it is defect-free. QUALITY CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX - Made in a vertically integrated factory certified for ISO-9001:2008, ISO-14001:2004 & ISO-18001:2007. SEDEX, OEKO-TEX and BSCI complied facility ensures sustainability, contribution to environment and corporate social responsibility. The fabric is thoroughly tested for meeting performance like no pilling, shrinkage, color fastness, tear strength and thread count authenticity before being individually measured and stitched to perfection. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We specialize in manufacturing the best queen size sheets & luxurious bedding in the industry. These breathable cool sheets use specially compacted yarns made from 100% long staple cotton. The fabric used in these premium organic cotton sheets are sweat-wicking and temperature balancing to keep you cool during summer and warm during winter. Our designs match any décor and are a wonderful gift idea for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zx4RTJQtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRANQUIL NIGHTS","source_asin":"B07HJDJDKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJDJDKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJDJDKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261048,"name":"5 pieces khuon banh cong Vietnamese cooking utensils, Vietnamese cookware set 5 pieces banh cong cake mold, banh cong mold assist the baker to shape t","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UrHB36DqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES:  5 pieces banh cong mold.  Made in: Vietnam.  Banh cong are a dish in Soc Trang province, Vietnam, a specialty of the Khmer in the South. The way do it is to put the flour and shrimp in the banh cong mold and fried.  The Banh Cong has a slightly dark color, banh cong are fragrant and extremely attractive. The cake is neither too big nor too small, on the top of the cake, a shrimp lying in a circle looks very attractive.  Biting into a piece, the crunchy dough spreads in the mouth, the aromatic, fatty taste of low fat, little green beans and meat.  Cake filling is a mixture of minced pork mixed with tapioca tubers and whole green beans ...  Everything blends together to create a characteristic flavor for Banh Cong.  The cake is not too fat, moderate fat, not greasy. Eat one, not yet absorbed any tower; eat more of the second, and the third has not yet craved ; Eat the fourth, maybe not even more, but its aroma still clings to you all the way …","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UrHB36DqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TJ-Store","source_asin":"B08Y94393F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y94393F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y94393F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
