window.products.push({"id":261144,"name":"Arkwright Pool Bath Towel - (Pack of 6) 100% Cotton Quick Dry Super Absorbent Beach Towels, Hotel Quality, Perfect for Workout, Gym, Bathroom, 22 x 44","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uBTauVuxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWER GYM BATH TOWEL: Arkwright's quick-drying bath towel collection is made of 100% cotton. These top-rated small light bathroom towels were initially designed as commercial gym bath towels, and are popular hotel pool towels. Complete your towel set with our power bath towels for the bathroom. POWER GYM BATH TOWEL VALUE PACKS: Pick up an economy set of 6 white 22\" x 44\" gym towels with a color center stripe. Our highly absorbent quick drying bath towels are available in plain white and blue, beige, pink, green, gold, and grey stripe. A BETTER BATH TOWEL DESIGN: Arkwright's Power bath towels are made from virgin fiber 12/S open-end yarn. Standard absorbent gym towels are made from inferior blended (virgin & reclaimed) fiber yarn. There's a visible difference in the structure of our white bath towels. Power gym towel's loop pile is low, uniform, and tight, with more loops-per-square-inch than competitive towels. MULTI-PURPOSE BATH TOWEL: Our Arkwright's white quick dry towel makes a terrific gym bathroom towel, Airbnb, VRBO guest bath towel, or hotel pool towel. Use as an oversized hand towel in powder rooms, or to dry hair as salon towels. CARING FOR YOUR POWER BATHROOM & GYM TOWEL: These white power bath towels are machine washable on gentle cycle. Do not use bleach. Tumble dry low. Do not iron. Our soft, lightweight gym towels are easy to wash and can hold up to multiple washes without thinning or unraveling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uBTauVuxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arkwright LLC","source_asin":"B0BKTXXJ77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKTXXJ77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKTXXJ77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261145,"name":"Kings Brand Furniture White Finish Wood Foldable 4 Tier Corner Shelves Bookcase Plant Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dG2rzynTL._AC_.jpg","description":"White Finish Wood Foldable 4 Tier Corner Shelves Bookcase Plant Stand. Dimension: 10”W x 10”D x 42”H. No assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dG2rzynTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GloryBear","source_asin":"B006CP9SYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006CP9SYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006CP9SYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261146,"name":"nuLOOM Veronica Vintage Distressed Runner Rug, 2' 6\" x 8', Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KDSKDafrL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KDSKDafrL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B0B85T2XTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B85T2XTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B85T2XTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
