window.products.push({"id":261159,"name":"Hamza Professional Chef Knife (8 Inch) German Stainless-Steel Cutlery | Cooking, Food Prep, Sous Vide | Kitchen Cutlery w/ Razor Sharp Precision, Ergo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O-065rB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare meals, food, and snacks with ultra-precision using this stainless-steel 8” chef’s knife from Hamza and enjoy ergonomic balance and control. Whether you’re a novice in the kitchen or working to become the next Iron Chef, it all starts with the right food prep knife. That’s why we created the Hamza Stainless-Steel Kitchen Chef’s Knife that provides a sharper, more precise edge, German reliability, and an ergonomic handle that gives you better control over every slice, cut, dice, and chop. These beautifully elegant chef’s knives are made for modern kitchens where comfortable convenience and sustainability are key to a great meal; which is why our knives are sharper, easier to handle, and cut through meats, vegetables, cheese, bread, and more with less effort. The perfect addition to your own kitchen or a great gift for aspiring artisans, get the Hamza Chef’s Knife and make preparing an unforgettable meal a smooth experience. Product Details: Stainless-Steel Chef’s Knife (8”) Stainless-Steel Chef’s Knife (8”) German Craftsmanship German Craftsmanship Precision Cutting Blade Precision Cutting Blade Ergonomic Handle Ergonomic Handle Scratch, Stain, and Corrosion Resistant Scratch, Stain, and Corrosion Resistant Dishwasher Safe Dishwasher Safe Satisfaction Guaranteed Satisfaction Guaranteed Click ‘Add to Cart’ above now to get this premium-grade chef’s knife and make preparing, serving, and enjoy a great meal easier, faster, and more efficient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O-065rB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HamZa Distribution","source_asin":"B079NS7VYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079NS7VYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079NS7VYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261160,"name":"CordaRoy's Chenille Nest Bean Bag Chair, Convertible Chair Folds from Chair to Bed, As Seen on Shark Tank, Navy, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":378.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k22rPfpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With CordaRoy's Chenille Nest Chair, a great night's sleep is in the bag! NEST is CordaRoy's first convertible chair with a defined top and bottom making you instantly feel safe, secure and cozy the second you fall back into it. There's a giant pillow that gets inserted into the chair cover by way of a zippered pocket on the interior of the cover. This crescent moon shaped pillow provides extra head, neck and back support and is completely removable when it's time to wash your chair cover. This chair also includes pockets for phones and remotes, and a handy handle on the back to make it easy to drag around to your favorite locations. This fun seating and sleeping solution is perfect for your for your living room, guest room, kid's room, basement, and more! The convertible chair changes froma chair to king-size bed in no time! To turn the chair into a bed, simply unzip the safe-lock zipper, remove the cover, and flip inner cushion. Fold and slide the cushions into cover to convert back to the original chair shape. So easy, the kids can do it! CordaRoy's Chenille Nest Chair is made of the highest quality materials for your comfort. Cover is made of plush microfiber fabric that is soft-to-touch with a durable woven backing. When it is time for a refresh, simply toss the cover in the washer and dryer for a convenient clean. CordaRoy's Chenille Nest Chair is compressed for convenient shipping straight to your doorstep. To set up your CordaRoy’s product, carefully remove the bed from the plastic and place inside the chair cover, ideally as soon as possible so the filling can decompress as intended. Please note that while the foam bed may look flat at first, it will expand within 3-7 days depending on the product size. Help activate and break apart the foam by fluffing, massaging, and scrubbing together the lumps from the outside. Use as normal for the next few days, and watch how your CordaRoy's bed continues to break down and get softer! The convertible chair comes complete with (1) King Chair Cover, (1) King Bed Insert and (1) Pillow Insert, everything you need to get comfortable right away. Nest chair seats 2 adults (60\" wide). King bed sleeps 2 adults (76\" x 80\" x 10\").","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k22rPfpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CordaRoy's","source_asin":"B0C4NKCXXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4NKCXXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4NKCXXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
