window.products.push({"id":261497,"name":"Craftiers Kitchens 7-Inch Rosewood Wooden Salad Bowls - Set of 4 Bowls for Cereal Fruit Pasta Rose Wood Bowl Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wmaFyX6RL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","description":"Gorgeous pieces you’ll be proud to leave out on your countertop or on the center table. We have created our line of Rose Wood serving, salad and fruit bowls - to offer products made with the highest quality lumber and manufactured with the utmost integrity. .SIZE : Simply perfect to serve individual meals, dinner with family or gathering party NATURAL AND UNIQUE 100% Hand crafted from richly grained rosewood makes each piece unique. Beautiful colors without a stain may vary due to natural wood construction. MORE THAN SIMPLE Simple and elegant piece with multiple-use naturally suited to everyday use. Great for green salad, pasta, bread, cereal, fruit or decor at your table; smaller bowls are convenient for serving individual portions of salad, rice, soup or appetizers . VERSATILE Tested and healthy food-safe Beeswax top-coat protects the wood and easy cleanup. Hand wash only with mild soapy warm water and dry thoroughly after every use. Wipe with oil for daily maintaining for lifetime use STURDY & DURABLE Every single piece of lumber is derived from ages old and naturally seasoned rosewood, ensuring desired moisture levels. Regular seasoning and proper maintenance would last the bowls for years to come. Care Wash your bowls with hot soapy water after each use and dry with a clean towel or let it air dry. For further sanitation, the bowls can be rinsed with a vinegar or chlorine bleach solution. (1 teaspoon bleach to one quart of water/5-to-1 ratio of vinegar to water)Do not soak the bowls in water, this will damage the wood. Like all natural wood bowls, Craftiers Kitchens bowlsare not intended for the dishwasher. Maintenance : Oil the bowls on all surfaces every 3-4 weeks to maintain its original looks and textures and then finish with beeswax. This quick task will protect and prolong the bowl’s life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wmaFyX6RL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Craftiers Kitchen","source_asin":"B07NVQHNBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NVQHNBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NVQHNBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
