window.products.push({"id":261500,"name":"VEAVON Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 200W 23Kpa Lightweight Cordless Stick Vacuum, Detachable Battery Design, 45 min Long Runtime, 4 in 1 Stick Vacuum Clea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAKKBNpmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【23KPa Powerful Suction & Detachable Battery Design】P6 Cordless vacuum cleaner motor produces a strong suction power of up 23000Pa at Max mode which is best for debris and deeply embedded dirt. Detachable Battery Design allows you to clean a larger family area. 【4 in 1 multi-scene cleaning&Easy use wall-mount】Equipped with multiple accessories, including a 2-in-1 brush, long crevice, window brush, this cordless stick vacuum can meet various household cleaning demands on stairs and windowsills, sofa and bed, desk and curtain, cars, RV, etc. It can be placed on the wall with wall-mount(included) and charge(charger included).At the same time,Light and convenient. And wall-mount can place different brush heads. 【V-shaped roller brush&Washable HEPA filter】The V-shaped roller brush design effectively reduces hair tangling and prolongs the service life of the roller brush. And the 5 stages HEPA filtration system capture 99.99% of fine dust as small as 0.1 microns, and expels purified clean air. HEPA filter is washable. 【5 LEDs light & Flexible swivel】Maneuverable Brush Head with 5 LEDs - Flexible 150°swivel sideways and 90°up and down lets you clean your home in all directions. 5 LED lights help vacuum cleaner cordless illuminate every dark area track dust and dirt. 【One-Touch dust removal&1-Year Warranty Service】Just press the dust cup button lightly, and the dust can be easily poured into the trash can, which really frees your hands. And we will provide 1 years quality and technical support and 7*24h customer service. Any question can contact with us-Perfect After-Sale-Service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAKKBNpmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEAVON","source_asin":"B0C3KQ7F9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3KQ7F9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3KQ7F9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261501,"name":"Ivation 18 Bottle Thermoelectric Wine Cooler/Chiller - Door Lock - Counter Top Red & White Wine Cellar w/Digital Temperature Display, Freestanding Ref","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21kf9brjw9L._AC_.jpg","description":"WINE COOLER (wine Cellar / Wine Chiller) A MUST HAVE: The only way to protect the quality and taste of your wines long or short term, and ensure it AGES at a consistent level, the wine has to be stored in the correct environment and CONSISTENT TEMPERATURE, (ideally in the range of 55° F) This free standing innovative wine cooler will protect your red or white wine, preserving its quality and rich flavors, so you could enjoy its real taste to the fullest. PERFECT Stable TEMPERATURE: The Ivation cooler enables you to store your wines short & long term in a consistent stable temp environment, and allows you to customize the temp to one that creates an ideal climate for your wines ageing process (Range 54º – 64ºF (12º – 18ºC), therefore bringing out the true characteristics and full flavor of your wines in the long-term. HUMIDITY, MINIMAL LIGHT: Insulated with Solid polyurethane heavy foam (CFC-free) & Closed with Thermopane doors that are tempered smoked, to ensure an interior odor-free environment that maintains constant humidity, keeping the cork from drying out, thus preventing more air to come into contact with the wine, also to ensure darkness, blocking out sunlight and harmful UV rays that breaks down the complex molecules that create the special flavors in properly aged wines. NO VIBRATION & SUPER QUIET: Specially built with an Energy-efficient thermoelectric cooling system with no compressor, to minimize the vibration effect and noise, allowing your wine to age and settle properly, with no disturbance to its natural occurring sediments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21kf9brjw9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B07C2CHSK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C2CHSK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C2CHSK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261502,"name":"Elktry Electric Wine Bottle Opener, Automatic Electric Corkscrew Wine Opener Battery Operated with Foil Cutter and Wine Pourer and Vacuum Stoppers for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uu2c0GqmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍷【7S One-touch Operation】Looking for a product that takes the hassle out of opening a bottle of wine? Within only 7 seconds, Elktry electric wine opener will do all the work for you! Just place it on the bottle, press the lower button to remove the cork, and then press the upper button to release the cork from the screw - no twisting or turning necessary. Definitely a must-have electric wine opener for wine lovers! 🍷【Ultimate 4 In 1 Gift Set】Elktry’s one-stop designed electric wine opener set has everything you need to enjoy (and preserve) any bottle of wine! A foil cutter is included for easy seal removal, and it can also be used as a base for the wine opener. The pourer works to enhance the taste of your wine and ensure a no-drip pour. The vacuum stopper can eliminate wasting wine and keep wine fresh all week! 🍷【Excellent Operation and Performance】Elktry electric wine bottle opener can open up to 100 bottles on 4 AA batteries. This high-performing electric wine opener features a delicate, yet powerful mechanism that can be used on any type of cork—synthetic or natural ones. And for those with mobility issues or an injury, Elktry electric wine opener is also a fantastic option. 🍷【Elegance Meets Intelligence】Form and function meet in Elktry’s electric wine bottle opener, which is made from sleek ABS material and black plastic. This electric wine opener smoothly extracts the cork from your wine in seconds, while its transparent vertical bar window of the corkscrew mechanism offers visible uncorking process and great user experience. 🍷【Makes an Amazing Present】The screw of electric wine opener adopts high-intensity food grade technology, with a cumulative life of 1000 bottles. The elegant design and package makes Elktry electric wine opener an attractive present for any wine lover, it is also a great tool to be used at parties, dates, birthdays, anniversary, Christmas and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uu2c0GqmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elktry","source_asin":"B096RX4CZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096RX4CZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096RX4CZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
