window.products.push({"id":261624,"name":"Menurto Potato Ricer with 3 Function Knife, Stainless Steel Potato Masher with 3 İnterchangeable Discs, Gnocchi Maker, Spaetzle Press, Easy to Use Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-Am+6My9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You like mashed potatoes served in restaurants and want to do the same at home? MENURTO potato ricer is exactly the kitchen tool you need. It is designed to help you find what you are looking for quickly and easily. It can press the fully cooked vegetable, potato, carrots, turnips, and fruits (grapes, lemon, juices, watermelon etc.) It allows you to make great baby foods. What can you make using MENURTO Potato Ricer? You can make mashed potatoes  You can make healthy and delicious baby food for your baby  You can make fruits juice  You can make spaetzle  You can make cauliflower rice  You can make gnocchi Why choose MENURTO Potato Ricer? Made from heavy duty, polished and high quality stainless steel  The handles are designed to allow the potatoes to be pressed more easily.  The product has 3 interchangeable discs set of fine, medium, coarse ricing discs. You make more than potatoes.  It is designed to be detachable for easy cleaning.  Ergonomic and comfortable handle provides convenience.   Its large capacity allows you to save time.  Size: 3.54 x 10.6 x 3.54 inches (90 x 270 x 90 mm)  The potato ricer helps you create smooth, fluffy and no lumps mashed potatoes quickly.  If you are a mother, you can prepare perfect baby foods for your baby. You can use potatoes, carrots, turnips and grapes, lemon, juices, watermelon, etc.  Suitable for home use and commercial activities. 3-FUNCTION KNIFE: For a short time, a 3-function knife is sent with your product as a gift. Do not miss this multifunctional gift suitable for peeling, shaving, slicing processes! It allows you to peel many fruits and vegetables such as potatoes, apples, cucumbers easily and quickly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-Am+6My9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08FH7ZVBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FH7ZVBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FH7ZVBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
