window.products.push({"id":261639,"name":"WeKit 6 Inch Utility Knife Kitchen Paring Knife Damascus Knives Japanese VG10 Chef Knife Sharpest 67-Layer High Carbon Stainless Steel Knife Sushi Mea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qr2a6wXoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional - The 6 inch utility knife is multifunctional and it would be a nice kitchen partner. V-sharp edge accurately hand sharpened to 10-15°per side for an effortless slicing experience. This multi-purpose full tang chef paring knife fits for chopping, mincing, slicing and dicing fruits, fish, meat, sushi, vegetables, etc. Damascus Steel High Carbon Material - The Utility Paring Knife Japanese VG10 super stainless steel possesses A hardness of 58-60 HRC. Besides the super core contains cobalt element which enhancing its hardness and keeps its sharpness. The blades are wrapped in 67 layers of Damascus steel, improving toughness and protecting the precious VG 10 steel cutting core. Each blade is cryogenically treated in liquid nitrogen to improve hardness, flexibility and corrosion resistance. Comfortable Elegant Handle - The Damascus chef knife possesses delicate enamel design.The weight of the handle is also strictly controlled and the right balanced weight between the handle and the thin blade ensures ease of movement. Even using for a long time, you would not feel tired and uncomfortable regardless your hand size or where you grip. Perfect Gift - VG10 chef kitchen utility knife is not only sharp, the design and manufacture of the handle is also superior. In addition, this Japanese chef utility knife with a exquisite gift box and a knife sheath is also proper as a gift to parents and friends on kinds of festivals like Christmas, Weddings, Birthdays, Thanksgiving Days and so forth. Quality Guarantee - 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK. Our Damascus knives are superior products that will give you a lifetime of exemplary service. We are committed to provide high quality products and friendly services for customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qr2a6wXoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WeKit","source_asin":"B0B3N2XJ98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3N2XJ98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3N2XJ98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
