window.products.push({"id":261668,"name":"Sofa Covers for L Shape, 2PCS Polyester Fabric Stretch Slipcovers + 2PCS Pillow Covers for Sectional Sofa L-Shape Couch #13","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u4DRZEgNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LSL-111-0624+LSL-111-0625@US Sofa Slipcover Size: 3 seater: 74-90\"/190-230cm 4 seater: 90-118\"/230-300cm Pillow Cover Size: 45*45cm/17.72*17.72in How to install Steps 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the back Steps 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tight Steps 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightly Steps 4: Put the sofa down and pll cover tight, pulling any excess fabric to the back Steps 5: Enjoy your newly coverd sofa! Attention -Do not use bleach and wash it with same/similar colours -Manual measurement 1-4cm error is allowable -The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen. Package Includes: 2pcs Sofa Covers + 2pcs Pillow Covers Some foam tubes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u4DRZEgNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beacon Pet","source_asin":"B07JH3VPJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JH3VPJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JH3VPJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261669,"name":"Bed Canopy, Bed Curtain for Single to King Size, Canopy Bed Curtains Round Lace Dome, Bedroom Indoor Outdoor Decor for Girls Boys Adults - Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dunuXx7fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BED CANOPY DIMENSIONS - 0.6 x 2.6 m / 23 x 102 in (top diameter x height), hem circumference: 11 m / 433 in. Perfect for most sizes of bed. Make the room or campsite more romantic and elegant. PREMIUM MATERIAL - The hanging bed canopy is made of high-quality polyester yarn, durable, soft, and lightweight. Features an opening for easy entrance. The breathable material is pretty good for kids. EASY TO ASSEMBLE - First, drill a hole in the ceiling with an electric drill; Second, insert the attached white expansion screw into the hole; And then screw the iron hook into the expansion screw, and finally hang the canopy bed curtain. FIT FOR VARIOUS BED - This curtain netting applies to a variety of models of bed, including Single bed/Twin bed/King bed/Queen bed (Width below 1.6M). Add extra romance and elegance to any bedroom. FANTASY GIFT - This Bed canopy net is ideal for providing a quiet environment when sleeping. A Dream gift for Girls, Kids, Boys, Adults. The bed curtain canopy gives the room a fairy tale feeling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dunuXx7fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jeteveven","source_asin":"B09NLZ75NM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NLZ75NM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NLZ75NM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":261670,"name":"aerolatte Moka Stovetop Espresso Pot Coffee Maker, 3 Cup Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZAaAH4m+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aerolatte’s MokaVista Stovetop Espresso Coffee Maker with a unique viewing window in the lid allows close monitoring for a precise coffee brewing process. This modern upgrade to the 1930s Italian classic inspired design is a simple, yet groundbreaking solution to the longstanding challenge of how to make espresso at home and master its precise timing. With a clear view inside the brewing chamber, it’s easy to see when coffee is done. No more guessing! No more over-extracted or burnt espresso! Much more precise than listening for percolations or periodically lifting the lid to check its progress. The lid helps retain precious heat so brewing isn’t interrupted and keeps coffee at its optimal drinking temperature. Additionally, a water level indicator inside the boiling chamber ensures the proper water-to-coffee ratio for the most flavorful cup and protects the pressure valve from being covered for safer brewing. Perfect coffee accessories for the coffee enthusiast and easy to use. Simply separate the top and bottom chambers. Remove funnel from the bottom chamber and fill with fresh water to the indicator line. Replace funnel and measure in finely ground coffee. Reassemble the top and bottom chambers and place the pot over a low heat. Once coffee begins to bubble from the percolating column (about 4 minutes), remove from heat and allow the pot to finish brewing. Wet grounds are retained in the bottom chamber and fresh-brewed coffee is collected in the top, ready to serve and enjoy. Stay-cool handle and knob on the lid keep hands away from heat. No-drip spout for mess-free serving. Resists rust. Hand wash in warm, soapy water. When used regularly, simply rinse with water and allow oils to coat the interior of the pot for a more complex flavor. Complete instructions included. Replacement silicone gasket and funnel are available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZAaAH4m+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aerolatte","source_asin":"B096LZG1ZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096LZG1ZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096LZG1ZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
