window.products.push({"id":261758,"name":"TSOLIAS.club Evzonas Figurine (red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lObrFlmLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Stavros Dimos design. Just add sunlight to see him in action. This solar Evzonas figure stand 9 inches high on a 3 inch base. The Evzones was a name used for several historical figures of the Greek Army who used to fight on the mountains. Today, it refers to the members of the Presidential Guard, an elite ceremonial unit that guards the Greek Tomb of the Unknown Soldier, the Hellenic Parliament and the Presidential Mansion. The Evzonas are also known, colloquially, as Tsolias. Generally a tsolias is a Greek soldier wearing a modern military uniform based on a traditional Greek guerrilla outfit from the 19th century's Greek War of Independence. The unit is famous around the world for its unique traditional uniform, which has evolved from the outfits worn by kleftes who fought the Turks during the Turkish occupation in Greece. The most visible item of this uniform is the fustanella, a kilt-like garment based on the ancient Greek tunic called a chiton. The fustanella is supposed to have over 400 folds, one for each year that Turkey occupied Greece. The red fez hat is a vestiage of Turkish occupation. The first King of Modern Greece, Otto wore this uniform often in public. Today, many Greek boys dress up as tsoliades on Greek Independence Day. Their proven valour and peculiar dress turned them into a popular image for the Greek soldier, especially among foreigners. The name Evzone is first found in Homer and it is referring to well-girt men, implying an elite status. For young men at least six feet tall, it is a great honor to become one of the Evzones, the primarily ceremonial Greek National Guard. The Greek Tsoliades are the most photographed figures in Greece. They stand still no matter what you say to them and it is not allowed to touch them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lObrFlmLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TSOLIAS.club","source_asin":"B07FN679JB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FN679JB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FN679JB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
