window.products.push({"id":261999,"name":"French Press Coffee Maker - 34 oz, Double-Wall 304 Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tea Brewer Pot with 4 Level Filtration System - Extra 2pcs Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716q67-QJUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Grade: The French press coffee maker is made of food-grade 18/10 (304)stainless steel that is 33% thicker and 20% heavier than the competition, making it more durable and rust-proof. No glass, NO crack, NO plastic and BPA-free. Do you like Hot Coffee? Yes, so do we. This type of coffee maker adopts a double-layer vacuum structure. The ‘keep warm’ for coffee is longer than that of a glass type, normally 2 to 3 hours. Enjoy hot coffee with your family! Hate coffee grounds? We do too. We use 18/10 stainless steel double-layer filter screens with 100 meshes to prevent coffee grinds from entering your coffee cup. Besides, extra 2pcs filter screens are provided, and the screen can be added and reduced according to the taste of coffee. Easy to Clean: The removable filter system and the smooth inner wall of the cup can facilitate the cleaning of all parts. At the same time, all parts can be cleaned in the dishwasher. User-Friendly Design: The French press coffee maker has a user-friendly, cool touch handle, and a screened plunger. It feels comfortable and will not scald your hand at any time. At the same time, we provide 12 months of quality assurance service, during which time we will provide replacement services for any quality problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716q67-QJUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOMICE","source_asin":"B07TT2MB3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-261999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TT2MB3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TT2MB3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":262000,"name":"Display Cake Board Footed Rectangle 35 x 45 cm (13.7 x 17.7 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-E9lx18DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You work hard to create your decorative cake, so opt for a display base that is equally stunning. The Avaré board facilitates handling your cake during decoration and transport. The matching white polypropylene feet attached to the board lift the cake off the table and allow your hands to get under the board for moving, transporting and setting up. Built with superior stability, the base is strong enough to hold heavy decorated cakes without needing an additional serving plate. The base's finish is grease resistant, food safe and reusable. The textured white melamine coating the board keeps it hygienic. The board is perfect for displaying all types of cakes and craft creations, including fondant cakes, stacked tiers, gingerbread houses, cookie assortments and pastries, as well as cold cuts, cheeses and party sandwiches. Cake Boards Avaré made its debut in 2004 in Brazil and now has more than 600 sales outlets in 22 Brazilian states. With a commitment to environmental awareness, Avaré works with reforestation wood. Adhering to the most rigorous standards, Avaré works with ISO 9002 quality of Medium Density Fiberboard (MDF), increasing productivity, practicality and hygiene in its products. With variety in shape and size, the trays are suitable for the most diverse uses and events. When this product came out it was the first of its kind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-E9lx18DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAKE BOARDS AVARE","source_asin":"B071J486XJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-262000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071J486XJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071J486XJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
